<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets 200 million mark six-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets 200 million mark six-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch, Frankfurt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    09.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     0.1875    PAY DATE    09.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.97     FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.97</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    5 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     LIST FEE    5 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
